# Sunstone Bazaar / 선스톤 바자르 — Sunstone Desert, D1, 3 × 1450 m, item★ (11-track-spec §12.3).
# 16:00 heat haze over a caravan town: the awning market street, the oasis-pond corner, palm S-bends, the dune
# hump, the camel-statue corner, the caravan road, the well-plaza sweeper, the rug market and the gate chicane.
# Sand shoulders on the oasis and dune sections teach the off-road slowdown (sand 0.85 grip / ×0.92).
# @signature branch, surfaces, jump
# @fallback jump -> "dune hump (no air)" when=F2
# @fallback branch -> "awning shortcut omitted; sweeper widened to 20 m with sand inside" when=F1
# @fallback hazard:traffic -> "static pot-cart prop" when=F5
TRACK sunstone_bazaar name="Sunstone Bazaar" theme=sunstone_desert diff=1 laps=3 topo=circuit
DEFAULTS w=18 surf=stone wall=building:2.5 shoulder=1 shoulderSurf=sand blend=16
START pos=(0,0,0) hdg=0
GRID rows=4 cols=2 pitch=7 stagger=3.5 d=4
S 199                                     @market_street # awning market street; pads +90/+140
C R35 90 L bank=6 w=19 shoulder=3 wall=rock:1.0 @oasis   # oasis-pond corner, sand both sides (V19)
S 63 w=18 shoulder=2                      @palms
WIGGLE R50 30/65/30 R bank=3              @palm_s
C R80 25 L                                @dune_approach
S ?b=75 dy=3 shoulder=3                   @dune_climb    # item row
S 25 dy=2 w=19                            @dune          # dune hump (jump fallback)
S 40 dy=-2
C R45 80 L bank=6 w=18                    @camel         # camel-statue corner (V19)
S ?c=155 dy=-3 shoulder=1.5 wall=building:2.5 @caravan
C R60 60 R bank=-4
C R40 120 L bank=8 w=20 shoulder=3        @well_plaza    # well-plaza sweeper (V19)
S 20 w=19
WIGGLE R55 30/65/40 L bank=3 w=18 shoulder=1 @rug_s
S 101                                     @rug_market
C R55 80 L bank=5                         @lantern
C R70 25 R ; C R70 40 L                   @gate_chicane
S ?a=98                                   @run_in
CLOSE solve=[?a,?b,?c] length=1450
LINE start at=0
ITEMS at=60,285,510,720,967,1160 n=5
PAD at=90,140 d=0 len=6 w=4
KEYS 230,480,700,900,1100,1330
